# a format 29 project, from before the master's color was a slot of the one effects list (format 30: its type off /
# tape / sampler becomes the catalog's effect, its amount, tone and mix knob 1, knob 2 and the mix: project.c): saved
# by that build, for the migration's test (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). The master color tape, amount 70, tone 40,
# mix 100; the EQ's low 80 and the comp 50 beside it (they stay where they were).
# Run by a format 29 build (751d120): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v29.xy
wait 300
bpm 117
mst color 1
mst camount 70
mst ctone 40
mst cmix 100
mst lo 80
mst comp 50
mst level 110
wait 40
projsave 1 v29_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v29.bin
